[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3073.589, "timestamp": "00:51:13", "text": "嘆。不掛。現在能聽到我說話嗎？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3077.069, "timestamp": "00:51:17", "text": "我想你聽得到我說話。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3084.71, "timestamp": "00:51:24", "text": "是的。在印度，工作日從早上 8 點開始，而時鐘離我們很遠。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3089.71, "timestamp": "00:51:29", "text": "現在是晚上8點。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3092.47, "timestamp": "00:51:32", "text": "當時是晚上8點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3102.63, "timestamp": "00:51:42", "text": "11點鐘會發生什麼事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3107.47, "timestamp": "00:51:47", "text": "不掛。現在是11點鐘，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3119.15, "timestamp": "00:51:59", "text": "嘆。"}]